<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 54,181 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 54,181 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 54,181 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Wednesday, compared to 95,098 tonnes on in the previous 24 hours.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Wednesday	Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			13,000	   12,568</p>
<p>    Import cargo			41,181	   82,530</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, six ships sailed and four berthed. In the next 24 hours, two ships were expected to sail and 12 were expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
